WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:00.923
- All right y'all,

00:00:00.923 --> 00:00:02.050
I wanna close out with a video

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:05.190
that's had a lasting impact on
me and some of my staff here.

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:06.390
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:08.941 --> 00:00:10.090
Before the break,

00:00:10.090 --> 00:00:13.600
we were celebrating spring and
maybe no one is more relieved

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.810
for some sunshine than this kid.

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:17.630
News cameras caught him hard at work

00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:21.211
after a snowstorm in
Toronto earlier this year.

00:00:21.211 --> 00:00:22.540
- If you didn't have a machine to help you

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:25.143
move the snow, you probably found it a bit

00:00:25.143 --> 00:00:26.830
- Tiring. Ugh.

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:33.960
- A snow day turned into a
work day for Carter Trozzolo.

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:36.480
- I really wish I was in school right now.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:38.510
- Trozzolo was clearing snow around

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:40.545
not just his house, but also doing it.

00:00:40.545 --> 00:00:43.545
- For my neighbors, friends,

00:00:43.545 --> 00:00:45.683
probably people I even don't know.

00:00:48.926 --> 00:00:50.927
(laughing and cheering)

00:00:50.927 --> 00:00:52.427
- It's so amazing.

00:00:53.929 --> 00:00:55.760
It's like a skip

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.700
Little Carter's sigh might
have been quiet and amazing

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.540
but it was a sigh heard around the world.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:03.900
In fact, that video's right
up more than 15 million views

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:07.010
and it helped Carter help
his neighbors even more.

00:01:07.010 --> 00:01:10.050
We have him on the line right
now watching on City TV.

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:11.813
What's up Carter.

00:01:13.145 --> 00:01:14.100
- Hi.

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:15.080
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:16.080
I wish you were here.

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:17.470
I wanna hug you so hard.

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:18.610
You're so cute.

00:01:18.610 --> 00:01:20.730
So Carter, how happy are you

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:23.100
that the snow season is over?

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.756
- I'm pretty happy Kelly,
shoveling that snow was

00:01:25.756 --> 00:01:28.918
really exhausting.

00:01:28.918 --> 00:01:30.610
- I love you.

00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:32.810
So the snow was really bad
that day, though, right?

00:01:32.810 --> 00:01:33.940
That was deep.

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:37.290
- Yeah. The biggest snow
storm I've seen in Toronto

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:40.260
I was, at the start

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:43.230
I was pretty happy that the
school day was canceled.

00:01:43.230 --> 00:01:45.610
And, but after a little while I got bored.

00:01:45.610 --> 00:01:48.200
So I asked my mom, what should I do?

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:50.970
And my mom said, I should
go and shovel outside

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:52.631
'cause I've been doing
it for a couple of years

00:01:52.631 --> 00:01:55.000
to help the community.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:57.903
And so I did, maybe an
hour and a half later,

00:01:57.903 --> 00:02:01.740
I'm finishing up and a news reporter comes

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:04.320
up to me and starts asking me questions.

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:07.488
And by then I was extremely exhausted.

00:02:07.488 --> 00:02:09.140
(laughing)

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:10.640
- I know one thing to know Carter,

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:13.204
never tell your parents you're bored.

00:02:13.204 --> 00:02:16.280
'Cause we will, we will find
something for you to do.

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:18.220
I love that you're like one
of the only kids on the planet

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:21.270
that's like I miss school right now.

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:23.444
So why do you think people
loved your video much,

00:02:23.444 --> 00:02:25.890
And what's happened since then?

00:02:25.890 --> 00:02:26.970
- I think they liked it

00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:29.256
because we're all exhausted from either

00:02:29.256 --> 00:02:32.200
COVID, work, isolation,

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:35.553
or other things that I have no idea about.

00:02:35.553 --> 00:02:40.553
And I know how they feel
'cause I am always exhausted.

00:02:41.578 --> 00:02:45.450
- Oh my God, Carter,
come back on our show.

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:46.610
Just every age of your life,

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:48.425
I just wanna see what's hap--

00:02:48.425 --> 00:02:50.540
I wanna know you as an adult one day.

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:52.110
Carter, you are so funny.

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:53.630
Oh, your parents must be hilarious.

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:55.290
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:58.020
We all love you for this.

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.540
And that's not all, my man,

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:01.440
our season long partner, Pilot Pen,

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:02.958
makers of Frixion, the go to erasable pen

00:03:02.958 --> 00:03:05.180
of the Kelly Clarkson
show, want to celebrate

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:06.180
those creating fearlessly

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:08.160
or helping out their
community, just like you.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:09.970
So they're gonna give
you a thousand dollars.

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:10.934
How's that sound?

00:03:10.934 --> 00:03:13.684
(crowd cheering)

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:17.663
See it was worth it.

